- The WebAssembly engine (editcore.wasm) and its JavaScript loader
  (editcore.js) are not stored in this repository. A preparation script copies
  them byte-for-byte from the pinned engine's Git objects into the ignored
  .runtime/ directory and checks their SHA-256 values. They are upstream
  binaries compiled from PDFium, HarfBuzz, the engine's editcore C++ sources
  and statically linked PDFium dependencies; this project has not
  independently rebuilt them. See UPSTREAM.json and docs/BUILD.md.

